    <title>「推理」消失的他</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7f15cb17676351c571f8b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7f15cb17676351c571f8b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 17:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1991 年 5 月 15&nbsp;日他消失了，但他的车子、车钥匙、家钥匙、工作用具都在，随后警方调查发现他女友家里的地毯下有血迹。</span></p><p><strong><span>他去哪里了？血迹是谁的？</span></strong><span>让我们一起探寻真相。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> 神秘失踪案与关键电话录音</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">03:06</a></span></strong><strong><span> 调查</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a></span></strong><strong><span> 现场</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a></span></strong><strong><span> 复杂关系</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a></span></strong><strong><span> 录音带与胶带</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">21:52</a></span></strong><strong><span> 维克多协会</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a></span></strong><strong><span> 找到尸体</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FntTOChdlNehFTCR7Rx8hdspmLhi.jpg"><p><span>🔼黄色跑车</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiJUsuFX_vAMDA-o3h1-DKYB5MYw.jpg"><p><span>🔼沙发下不见的地毯的面积和剪切形状</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmemeNY2DUD80QuR6fIMB6yejfBi.jpg"><p><span>🔼卧室里地毯下的血迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjxOAdfqkFva9CrbuPFfgoYSwIRW.jpg"><p><span>🔼血迹通过地毯渗透到地面上的血点</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvJ3IkWZEeR3bC2ybiv6IDntlsEL.jpg"><p><span>🔼钝器击打形成的飞溅血迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnug_q01Y71c_9Uz4XHpotB5jTX2.jpg"><p><span>🔼门把手上的血迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlDmlZHoh5AWhP2b5tao0WH-3pmf.jpg"><p><span>🔼卧室墙角处被擦拭掉的血迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmDQQpRpGKPMoMYzFMfcIL-WGFad.jpg"><p><span>🔼藏在书后面的胶带</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiKhJgREBxFlySrUInhkjCL-xw29.jpg"><p><span>🔼胶带上纤维</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmgeq1JxlKQRYnJK2-yMpTZ_B9l7.jpg"><p><span>🔼维克多学会</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqNzia7ZJl4mZagMMQvt_hluc2nb.jpg"><p><span>🔼血迹量试验</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqOMkiS3Wt_WDFptTt9Lf2zBCyUq.jpg"><p><span>🔼胶带上的毛发送检样本</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
