  <item>
    <title>高智商犯罪「推理」警犬探案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6cc956b581962ce2beb356</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6cc956b581962ce2beb356</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 16:16:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1992 年 10 月美国马里兰州，哈佛毕业生莉莉，邻居亲眼看见她清晨出门赶火车，之后就消失不见。</span></p><p><span>警方却在她卧室床垫，找到大片被刻意清洗的血迹，梳妆台的梳子上，还残留一缕不属于她的假发纤维。</span></p><p><span> 床垫血迹从何而来？</span></p><p><span>凭空出现的假发纤维，又会指向谁？</span></p><p><span>一个微小线索如何破解这场离奇失踪？</span></p><p><strong><span>破解本案的是一名叫夏洛克的狗狗。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> 哈佛毕业</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a></span></strong><strong><span> 最后接触</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a></span></strong><strong><span> 警犬追踪</span></strong></p><p><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a></span></strong><strong><span> 合成纤维</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a></span></strong><strong><span> 嫌疑人X</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a></span></strong><strong><span> 关键证据</span></strong></p><p><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a></span></strong><strong><span> 发现尸骸</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a></span></strong><strong><span> 犯罪动机</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a></span></strong><strong><span> 揭露真相</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><strong><span>谁是神探福尔摩斯</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>以下物证图片，你能从血迹中看到哪些信息？</span></strong></p></blockquote><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FseSY1t2cJLlFzmJelFaYWPGtoTY.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FghzNIqRGT60B-GppT3xPH0Ie6_u.jpg"><blockquote><p><strong><span>案件相关图片</span></strong></p></blockquote><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrPqagMLxMwCdu0kReXSBWT3jrqg.jpg"><p><br><span>🔼敞开的后门</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhEe-m9IqG59Q9ltd7qv2LgTDFK8.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv2hU2VgBn2Yujv5z6wlXCHKXPKu.jpg"><p><span>🔼现场卧室及床铺情况（被褥被扔在地上）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjbXoyufT3kGRL6Otxs_75LgTWFz.jpg"><p><span>🔼梳子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmL49pufjkETax0UZB44d0wqQWR-.jpg"><p><span>🔼树林找到的带血枕套</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWmKXjjU8XNX7Ntdnca4P3KyrnE.jpg"><p><span>🔼床垫上被清洗的3处血迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq8aIC-Mn9JJ3Dim5qznql4HnYnf.jpg"><p><span>🔼枕套与园丁停车位置</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuIgNMPoJVIOTqw6g1gPD7Tc0Q-J.jpg"><p><span>🔼清单上列明的储藏室</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjM_0sy17asAuWofini91eJwZ1i9.jpg"><p><span>🔼枕头上的血迹和双亲的比对</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhaMzzk64YYE8WYAq0Fq4qJEdL6O.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpoiz2lCVUCGBrjI12hWcnO7MDUK.jpg"><p><span>🔼枕套上的指纹和剪刀痕迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjdwoPLBGImwrcZz_qpL-2PKzES0.jpg"><p><span>🔼警犬夏洛克在执行公务</span></p><p><span>片头曲和片尾曲简介图片</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGIOaWGauu1FxXiq7xZBoHR2Qsr.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
