    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1991年7月6日，一居民在温哥华市发现垃圾箱内有疑似炭化手指。</span></p><p><span>谁是凶手？警方又怎样能从碳化的现场中找到线索？</span></p><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 炭化手指</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> 焚尸案</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 确认年龄</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 牙齿特征</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">12:19</a> 身亡之谜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 冒名者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 新方向</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> 身兼多职</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> 钱包传递</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 说谎真相</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 通过牙髓</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 还原案件</span></p><p><strong><span>案件相关图片</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl6n0zbiPeM94EePvgfRuLr9oqcZ.jpg"><p><strong><span>案发现场垃圾箱</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fka7NDvGbAE-Jd5roD4IHsvBRsWB.jpg"><p><strong><span>俯视图</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuwHwWhRhVR-WNUINyeOATxeGcn6.jpg"><p><strong><span>现场全景</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBDrfZTfxJvnkxU9Vd7DmxEc04N.jpg"><p><strong><span>楔形牙</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnYBx9VLU_75kY6xCJSWdn0Qb-qa.jpg"><p><span>银行冒名者和曝光过度图像</span></p>]]></description>
