  <item>
    <title>高智商犯罪「夏日特辑」谁是凶手</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a3fbd319d2f5743683eb947</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a3fbd319d2f5743683eb947</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 16:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj3fsPKxDoK2cQ3s5125lB0XDe8g.jpg"><p><strong><span>1. 法医判断死者大致死亡时间，最常优先观察的身体现象是？</span></strong></p><p><span>A. 尸体身上的香水味</span></p><p><span>B. 尸僵、尸冷、尸斑</span></p><p><span>C. 指甲长短</span></p><p><span>D. 头发褪色程度</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>2.听声辨味，以下哪个声音是吃花生米的声音？</span></strong></p><p><span>A？</span></p><p><span>B？</span></p><p><span>C？</span></p><p><span>D？</span></p><p><span>E？</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>3. 案发现场的指纹里，哪种最容易被肉眼直接看到？</span></strong></p><p><span>A. 沾了汗液的隐形指纹</span></p><p><span>B. 沾了血迹、油脂的指纹</span></p><p><span>C. 书架上书本里的指纹</span></p><p><span>D. 梦里留下的指纹</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>4. 警方调查入室盗窃案时，鞋印主要用来做什么？</span></strong></p><p><span>A. 判断嫌疑人穿的鞋好不好看</span></p><p><span>B. 锁定鞋款、身高体重、行走习惯</span></p><p><span>C. 猜出嫌疑人喜欢什么牌子</span></p><p><span>D. 用来当证据贴墙上展示</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>5. 罪案里常说的DNA比对，一般不会用以下哪种东西提取？</span></strong></p><p><span>A. 烟头、水杯</span></p><p><span>B. 头发、指甲</span></p><p><span>C. 空气和风</span></p><p><span>D. 血迹、唾液</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>6. 警方判断一个脚印是不是嫌疑人的，主要看脚印的？</span></strong></p><p><span>A. 花纹深浅、磨损、受力角度</span></p><p><span>B. 好不好看</span></p><p><span>C. 颜色漂不漂亮</span></p><p><span>D. 大小和自己鞋一不一样</span></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>答案</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.答案：B</span></strong></p><p><span>解析：尸冷、尸斑、尸僵是法医判断早期死亡时间最核心的三大尸体现象。</span></p><p><strong><span>3.答案：B</span></strong></p><p><span>解析：血迹、油脂会形成可见痕迹，汗液指纹需特殊试剂显现。</span></p><p><strong><span>4.答案：B</span></strong></p><p><span>解析：足迹可通过长度、压力分布推断身高体重与步态特征，锁定嫌疑人范围。</span></p><p><strong><span>5.答案：C</span></strong></p><p><span>解析：DNA仅存在于人体细胞组织，空气无生物细胞无法提取。</span></p><p><strong><span>6.答案：A</span></strong></p><p><span>解析：鞋底磨损与受力角度是个体独有的特征，用于足迹同一认定。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>讨论题</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>第一题</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgtTzBPZl9gi97xAVUT48HdZHLCL.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrIJK38OeuH2rjEJad52LLBtwpSA.PNG"><p><strong><span>第二题</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmFSndz7tv7MDNYU9sumeuLe4JDl.PNG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm_W1tqqCDNGWVv6EaGlLM02G4e-.PNG"><p><span>最后祝大家夏日快乐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/656ff283c5595492c4bbfeed/lusrSdkUZLAHe5KDcuwe5CZpM2Ca.m4a" length="26261372" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqiKQ3f7wtOYnDB_cZiUL3i_K0Yg.png"/>
