    <title>高智商犯罪「推理」血色马拉松</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684480c979e285b9b8be907a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">684480c979e285b9b8be907a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Jun 2025 18:15:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwNvNss1nXquOdUC0WSjxZGEFyZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>请各位侦探，阻止案件发生</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-推理小组-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>丁丁×丁瑶</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-声明-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本播客的内容仅代表个人观点，并不代表任何律师事务所或律师的任何形式的法律意见或建议。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-案件可视化-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 爆炸</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> 调查</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 白帽</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> 是否公开炸弹案嫌疑人照片的决策难题</span></strong><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> 追踪</span></strong><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 嫌疑人最终落网</span></strong><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 回顾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>​</span><strong><span>2013年4月15日</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>14: 49</span></strong><span>​：波士顿马拉松终点线（671号和755号）发生两起高压锅爆炸，间隔</span><strong><span>12秒</span></strong><span>，相距约</span><strong><span>45-91米</span></strong><span>​。</span></p><span></span><p><span>​</span><strong><span>4月16日（调查启动）​</span></strong><span>​</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;FBI分析</span><strong><span>10万+张照片/视频</span></strong><span>，锁定两名戴棒球帽（白帽、黑帽）的可疑男子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;爆炸物确认：​</span><strong><span>高压锅</span></strong><span>，内含钢珠</span></p><span></span><p><span>​</span><strong><span>4月18日（公布嫌疑人）​</span></strong><span>​</span></p><span></span><p><span>​</span><strong><span>17: 00</span></strong><span>​：FBI公开嫌疑人照片</span></p><span></span><p><span>​</span><strong><span>22: 00</span></strong><span>​：两人枪杀MIT校警Sean Collier，劫持车辆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>​</span><strong><span>4月19日（追捕）​</span></strong><span>​</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;​</span><strong><span>00: 30</span></strong><span>​：警方与兄弟交火，黑帽子中弹后被白帽子驾车碾压拖行致死。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;​</span><strong><span>18: 00</span></strong><span>​：船</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;​</span><strong><span>19: 00</span></strong><span>​：全城戒严解除，抓捕耗时</span><strong><span>101小时</span></strong><span>​。</span></p>]]></description>
